{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your style. Do you prefer speed? Or maybe control? Or more damage?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/2fc5920e09cd99a7a863160bda764534.poster.avif?t=1770175328\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/2fc5920e09cd99a7a863160bda764534.webm?t=1770175328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/2fc5920e09cd99a7a863160bda764534.mp4?t=1770175328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your strategy with satellite pedestals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/e7cca92a0303b51afdadd4d55130dbcd.poster.avif?t=1770175328\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/e7cca92a0303b51afdadd4d55130dbcd.webm?t=1770175328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/e7cca92a0303b51afdadd4d55130dbcd.mp4?t=1770175328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each wave you will visit the shop, where you can buy, sell, upgrade and copy your crests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/e73e15e3fea30c7edbfd1d0828945e29.poster.avif?t=1770175328\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/e73e15e3fea30c7edbfd1d0828945e29.webm?t=1770175328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/e73e15e3fea30c7edbfd1d0828945e29.mp4?t=1770175328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By defeating enemies, you will gain essence that you can use for various purposes, such as acquiring improvements in the skill tree, new crests and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/897b6807d07097b983fcda3775fdb730.poster.avif?t=1770175328\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/897b6807d07097b983fcda3775fdb730.webm?t=1770175328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/897b6807d07097b983fcda3775fdb730.mp4?t=1770175328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You embody Union, a small being with no memories, in its adventure within the world of Anima, along with various characters with particular situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/588ef6f2511884842c3f811152e2b4c7.poster.avif?t=1770175328\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/588ef6f2511884842c3f811152e2b4c7.webm?t=1770175328\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/extras/588ef6f2511884842c3f811152e2b4c7.mp4?t=1770175328\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Meeting Guide","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3390470/5ba9881b0e57553872fb6f7b465aac79e959f91a.jpg"},{"name":"Genuine Concern","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3390470/2b5286eb40540dfab427d6fdb15c85d5dd18c0be.jpg"},{"name":"Unwavering Ally","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3390470/6eada1e53974aa787855ac923b6711822dd97b5f.jpg"},{"name":"Unwavering Ally","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3390470/0a53625d18040e9cf1ba4681bc4a872c5d7d0fbb.jpg"},{"name":"Research in Progress","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3390470/8284e3e59f6c806439833509bbd105f7a73dd640.jpg"},{"name":"Synchronized Minds","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3390470/4b2f48bc4440cd90f9f81bd0337582508a941eed.jpg"},{"name":"Unquenchable Curiosity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3390470/db5ad32d9372eb4219fc621fa49a5d2747dcc801.jpg"},{"name":"Unquenchable Curiosity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3390470/07882eb361588250c7a1c108c9be2e62addc4254.jpg"},{"name":"Forest Enigma","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3390470/411b8d808d4bfa48ee52656247525da8694dc47a.jpg"},{"name":"Voice in the Wind","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3390470/d9f4fdfab944e18d863c9e61b14ee377b74a76eb.jpg"}],"total":72},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3390470?t=1770175328","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3390470/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770175328","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store